From: blame42 <346530647+git-blame-42@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 16:12:19 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat: Add Event status with cancel and finish actions

Adds events.status (scheduled, canceled, finished; scheduled by default in the constructor). PUT /admin/events/{id}/cancel and /finish call Event::cancel() and Event::finish(). Status badge in the listing and in the show page; a canceled Event cannot be edited.
